e la sève ; muni d'un robinet, il produit de la résine.","description_en":"Poplar tree are a common type of tree found in deep forest that can be grown from poplar seeds. Poplar tree can be shaken to obtain poplar seeds, can be cut down to obtain poplar seeds, hardwood and sap, or tapped to produce resin.","description_lang":"fr-trad","obtention":[],"lieux":[],"saisons":["spring","summer","fall","winter"],"meteo":[],"horaires":[],"prix":null,"prerequis":[],"utilise_dans":["resin"],"aime_par":{},"extra":{"ebauche":true,"graine_brut":"Poplar seeds","croissance":5},"liens":["hardwood","resin","sap","tap","trees"],"sources":[{"name":"Coral Island Wiki (Fandom)","url":"https://coralisland.fandom.com/wiki/Poplar_tree","rev":60504,"date":"2024-12-27"}],"confiance":"basse","a_verifier":["obtention"]},{"id":"shroomba-tree","nom_fr":"Shroomba tree","nom_en":"Shroomba tree","nom_fr_source":"en","nom_fr_alias":"Arbre Shroomba","categorie":"Arbre","image":{"url":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/coralisland/images/2/2f/Shroomba_seeds.png/revision/latest?cb=20241221183439","w":128,"h":128,"file":"Shroomba seeds.png"},"description":"L'arbre Shroomba pousse dans la Grotte des souvenirs (Savane) à partir de graines de Shroomba. Secoué, il donne des graines ; abattu, des graines, de la boue gluante, du bois dur et des morilles ; muni d'un robinet, il produit des boules gluantes.","description_en":"Shroomba trees are a common type of tree found in cave of memories in Savannah that can be grown from shroomba seeds. A shroomba tree can be shaken to obtain shroomba seeds, or can be cut down to obtain shroomba seeds, slime goop, hardwood, and morel, or tapped to produce ball of goop.","description_lang":"fr-trad","obtention":[],"lieux":[],"saisons":["spring","summer","fall","winter"],"meteo":[],"horaires":[],"prix":null,"prerequis":[],"utilise_dans":["ball-of-goop"],"aime_par":{},"extra":{"ebauche":true,"graine_brut":"Shroomba seeds","croissance":5},"liens":["ball-of-goop","cave-of-memor